{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16953","headline":"顺宗至德大圣皇帝挽歌词三首 一 · 武元衡","name":"顺宗至德大圣皇帝挽歌词三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桥山同轨会，轩后葬衣冠。\n东海风波变，西陵松柏攒。\n鼎湖仙已去，金掌露宁乾。\n万木泉扃月，空怜凫雁寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}